Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 05:15:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Remove interface shadow recording

Delete drawer and tongue shadow calls, shadow and glow drawing APIs, layered approximation code, shadow inks, the unused rail glow declarations, and the now-unused coverage helper and cmath include. The interface no longer records any shadow or glow geometry; generated indexes remain for the local construction step.
